---
import TextPage from '../../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE, adsEnabled } from '../../config/site';
---
<TextPage title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.name}`} description={`How ${SITE.name} handles data, cookies and advertising.`} h1="Privacy policy" path="/privacy/" updated="November 15, 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what information {SITE.name} (“we”) collects when you use this website and how it is used.</p>
  <h2>Calculations stay on your device</h2>
  <p>Every calculator runs in your browser. Numbers and dates you enter — including a date of birth in the age calculator — are not sent to our servers. If you use “Save”, the calculation is stored in your browser’s local storage, which you can clear at any time from the Saved page or your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>Server logs</h2>
  <p>The site is served through Cloudflare. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical data such as IP addresses and browser type to deliver pages and protect against abuse. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="nofollow noopener">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdSense to show ads that keep the site free{adsEnabled() ? '' : ' (ads are not currently running)'}. Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other websites. When you first visit, we ask whether you accept personalised ads; if you choose “Non-personalised only”, Google shows ads that are not based on your browsing history (cookies may still be used for frequency capping and fraud prevention). You can change your choice via “Cookie settings” in the footer.</p>
  <p>Learn how Google uses data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>, and opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>If you are in the UK, EU or Canada, you may have rights to access or delete personal data held about you. Because we do not store calculations or accounts, we usually hold no personal data beyond emails you send us. To make a request, use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is for a general audience and is not directed at children under 13.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We will update this page if our practices change, and revise the date at the top.</p>
</TextPage>
